### Ledger of a programme, newest first
GET {{api}}/v1/audit/ledger?programId={{programId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auditor}}

### Inbox: decisions on treasury messages
GET {{api}}/v1/audit/inbox?programId={{programId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auditor}}

### Rejected treasury messages
GET {{api}}/v1/audit/inbox?outcome=REJECTED
Authorization: Bearer {{auditor}}

### Parked messages still waiting
GET {{api}}/v1/audit/parked?unresolved=true
Authorization: Bearer {{auditor}}

### Funding history of a reservation
GET {{api}}/v1/audit/fundings?reservationId={{reservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auditor}}

### Outbox events not published yet
GET {{api}}/v1/audit/outbox?unpublished=true
Authorization: Bearer {{auditor}}

### Decline journal
GET {{api}}/v1/audit/declines?code=INSUFFICIENT_CAPACITY
Authorization: Bearer {{auditor}}

### Internal reconciliation on demand
GET {{api}}/v1/audit/reconciliation
Authorization: Bearer {{auditor}}

###
